            <div xml:id="d911">

                <pb facs="0715" n="599" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg599"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/13222a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Brazilian Minister to Mexico.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-09-17T13:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 17, 1914, 1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Our telegram No. 246 of 15th answered your inquiry of same date relative to
                    evacuation. Please discourage any immediate requests for recognition. You will
                    be advised whenever the President feels the time is ripe for such action.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
